pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:7: ## E1: historical native serving measurements, not MPC
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:8: 
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:9: Hardware/configuration: RTX 4090, reported 24,564 MiB, driver 595.91.07;
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:10: Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507, vLLM 0.30.0, Torch 2.13.0+cu130, Python 3.12.3.
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:11: Both captures replay the same Azure-derived arrivals/input lengths with
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:12: synthetic prompts, output cap 128, context 8192 and 300-second arrival windows.
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:13: Source output lengths are not replayed. TTFT SLO is 0.5 seconds.
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:14: 
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:15: | Capture | Offered | Completed success | Rejected | Failed | SLO-good completions | SLO goodput (req/s) | Client TTFT p99 (s) |
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:16: |---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:17: | Shared A | 7,643 | 1,976 | 5,667 | 0 | 572 | 1.906667 | 2.412583 |
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:18: | Shared B | 7,643 | 2,059 | 5,584 | 0 | 736 | 2.453333 | 2.202635 |
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:19: 
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:20: TTFT p99 is conditional on successful requests; rejection is shown alongside
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:21: it. SLO goodput counts eventual successful completions whose first content
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:22: meets the scheduled-arrival TTFT deadline, divided by offered duration.
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:23: The arrival window is not total wall time including startup/drain.
