pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:25: These are **scheduled identification captures on different hosts**, not MPC,
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:26: Fixed/OneMove comparisons, causal schedule effects or proof of an optimal cap.
pinned-docs/benchmark_results.md:27: Historical integrity/load/control qualification does not mean every request
